  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved working conditions in line with labour law and international standards.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inadequate recording and notification mechanisms for work-related injuries and diseases were among the findings of a recent assessment of the occupational safety and health (OSH) system in Iraq, for which the development of a modern electronic recording and notification system is considered a priority for this biennium. Developing an electronic case management system, which is also a priority, would contribute to improving relevant data and statistics in a sex-disaggregated manner.</narrative>
  </description>
